      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/27-puffers/sphoeroides_annulatus_en/",
      "html": "<p>Sphoeroides annulatus is a pufferfish that is primarily a seawater fish, but juveniles are often found in pure freshwater. Keeping the species in brackish water is recommended. It can reach a maximum length of 40 cm.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
